     C* ===============================================================
     C*
     C*  Get the user parameter file
     C     UPKY          CHAIN     PUP01                              60
     C*
     C*  If the get was unsuccessful, end the program
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      '99999'       QQS(1)
     C                   MOVE      '95'          QQC(1)
     C* Err Msg 95: "Invalid User Parameter, See Programmer"
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  Get the Claim Master Record
     C     CMKY          CHAIN     PCM01                              60
     C*
     C*  If the get was unsuccessful, end the program
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      '99998'       QQS(1)
     C                   MOVE      '96'          QQC(1)
     C* Err Msg 96: Invalid Case Number, See Programmer
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C                   END
     C*
     C* Find the recon number.  If this is a recon.
     C     EOKY          CHAIN     PEO01                              60
     C*
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      *OFF
     C                   Z-ADD     EORCN         XXRCN
     C*
     C                   ELSE
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XXRCN
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN60=OFF
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        KKYMD
     C*
     C     CAKYH         SETLL     PCA01
     C     CAKYH1        READE     PCA01                                  54
     C*
     C*+*+*+*+*+*+* Do Loop for Each Claim Detail Record +*+*+*+*+*+*+*+*+*+**
     C     *IN54         DOWEQ     '0'                                          DO FOR EACH RCD
     C*
     C                   EXCEPT    ECA01
     C*
     C     CAFDAT        IFGE      1000101
     C     XXRCN         ANDEQ     CARCN
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     CAFDAT        XXYMD
     C                   Z-ADD     CADSEQ        KKDSEQ
     C*
     C     DHKY          CHAIN     PDH01                              60
     C*
     C                   SELECT
      *
     C     DHMOD1        WHENNE    *BLANKS
     C                   MOVEL     DHMOD1        XPPMOD
      *
     C     DHMOD2        WHENNE    *BLANKS
     C                   MOVEL     DHMOD2        XPPMOD
      *
     C     DHMOD3        WHENNE    *BLANKS
     C                   MOVEL     DHMOD3        XPPMOD
      *
     C     DHMOD4        WHENNE    *BLANKS
     C                   MOVEL     DHMOD4        XPPMOD
      *
     C                   ENDSL
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     CADSEQ        SVDSEQ                         SAVE FIELD VALS
     C                   MOVE      CAFEIN        SVFEIN                         FOR RECORD WE
     C                   MOVE      CAMOD         SVMOD                          ARE PROCESSING
     C                   MOVE      CAPRTY        SVPRTY
     C                   Z-ADD     DHUNTS        SVUNTS
     C                   MOVEL     DHPRCD        XPCPT4
     C                   MOVEL     XPPMOD        XPPMOD
     C                   Z-ADD     CAEOB#        SVEOB#
     C                   Z-ADD     CACHK#        SVCHK#
     C*
     C* ---------------------------------------------------------------
     C* --- Get and save the Provider's Zip Code/Region ---------------
     C* --- this will be used in each subroutine to determine conversion factor
     C                   MOVE      CAFDAT        XXEFDT
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        SVZIP
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        SVRGN#
     C                   MOVE      ' '           ZIPERR
     C                   MOVEL     EOFLIC        SVZIP
     C     ZRKY          SETGT     PZR01
     C                   READP     PZR01                                  60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C     SVZIP         ANDGE     ZRFZCD
     C     SVZIP         ANDLE     ZRTZCD
     C                   MOVE      ZRRGN#        SVRGN#
     C                   ELSE                                                   ELSE 0 *IN60
     C* If no hit on Zip/Region file, then use lowest region
     C                   Z-ADD     4             SVRGN#
     C                   MOVE      '1'           ZIPERR
     C                   END                                                    END 0 *IN60
     C*
     C* ---------------------------------------------------------------
     C*
     C                   MOVE      CAFEIN        SXFEIN                         SET PROVIDER WE
     C                   MOVE      CAMOD         SXMOD                          ARE PROCESSING
     C*
     C                   MOVE      QQSPCD        SVSPCD
     C*
     C* If the Service Date is greater than the system date, give err message
     C     CAFDAT        IFGT      SYDATE
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     CADSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      '79'          QQC(Q)
     C*** Err Msg 79: "Service Date entered is greater than today's date
     C*                (system date)."
     C                   END                                                    END GT SYDATE
     C*
     C                   MOVE      '0'           XX25EM
     C*
     C*  Get the claim status record.  See if Override Flag is 'Y'.
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        TABKEY
     C                   MOVEL     CACSCD        TABKEY
     C     TCSKY         CHAIN     PCS01                              60
     C*
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     CADSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      '97'          QQC(Q)
     C* Err Msg 97: "Invalid Claim Status Code, See Programmer"
     C                   END
     C*
     C*** NOT OVERRIDE ************************************************
     C*
     C* If override flag is not equal to 'Y', then process this record
     C*    Else do not adjudicate.
     C*
     C     CSOVRD        IFNE      'Y'
     C*
     C*== R&C =========================================================
     C* Check to see if this record is a Reasonable/Customary record
     C     CARCFL        IFEQ      'Y'                                           REAS/CUST
     C*
     C                   MOVEL     DHPRCD        XXCPCD
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       XPEOMB
     C                   MOVE      *ZEROS        XPTOTA
     C                   MOVE      *ZEROS        XPTOTP
     C                   MOVE      *ZEROS        XPTOTD
     C*
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       XXFRZP
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       XXZIPA
     C     PDKY          CHAIN     PPD01                              60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C* Now that the Provider is established, get its Geographic Zip Area
     C* 1st - establish the first 3-bytes of the zip code
     C                   MOVEL     PDZIP         XXFRZP
     C                   END                                                    END 0 *IN60
     C*
     C* 2nd - Get the corresponding Geographic Zip Area record:
     C     GZKY          SETGT     PGZ01
     C                   READP     PGZ01                                  60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C     XXFRZP        ANDLE     GZTOZP
     C                   MOVE      GZZIPA        XXZIPA
     C                   END                                                    END 0 *IN60
     C*
     C     RCKY          SETGT     PRC01
     C     NXRC1         TAG
     C                   READP     PRC01                                  60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C     RCCO#         ANDEQ     QQCO#
     C     RCZIPA        ANDEQ     XXZIPA
     C     RCCPT4        ANDEQ     XXCPCD
     C     RCSTAT        IFNE      'I'
     C*
     C*** IF PROCEDURE IS "BY-REPORT" FLAG IT AS SUCH AND UPDATE RECORD.
     C     RCRPT         IFEQ      'Y'
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     CADSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      '91'          QQC(Q)
     C                   Z-ADD     CACHRG        XPTOTD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTA
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTP
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C                   GOTO      NXTRCD
     C*
     C                   ELSE                                                   ELSE RCRPT EQ 'Y'
     C*
     C     CACHRG        COMP      RCMRA                              61
     C   61              MOVE      '206'         XPEOMB
     C* EOMB Code 206: "This charge has been paid per R&C fees"
     C   61              Z-ADD     RCMRA         XPTOTA
     C  N61              Z-ADD     CACHRG        XPTOTA
     C     CACHRG        SUB       XPTOTA        XPTOTD
     C                   Z-ADD     XPTOTA        XPTOTP
     C*
     C                   END                                                    END RCRPT EQ 'Y'
     C*
     C                   ELSE                                                    ELSE RCSTAT NE "I"
     C                   GOTO      NXRC1
     C                   END                                                     END RCSTAT NE "I"
     C                   END                                                     END 0 *IN60
     C*
     C     CAKY1A        CHAIN     PCA01                              54
     C     *IN54         IFEQ      '0'
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C                   GOTO      NXTRCD
     C                   END
     C*
     C                   END                                                     END CARCFL = Y
     C*
     C*== =============================================================
     C*
     C*   Check for level break (Provider)
     C     SXFEIN        IFNE      CAFEIN
     C     SXMOD         ORNE      CAMOD
     C                   EXSR      NEWPRO
     C                   END
     C*
     C*== Hospital ====================================================
     C*
     C*   Hospital Subroutine or Regular Providers.
     C     CARCFL        IFEQ      'S'
     C     CARCFL        OREQ      'N'
     C                   GOTO      NXTRCD
     C*
     C*== Non-Hospital ================================================
     C*
     C                   ELSE                                                   Else EQ 'S/N'
     C*
     C*  Test for Fee Schedule Reimbursement = 'Y'
     C                   MOVEL     DHPRCD        XXCPT4
     C                   MOVE      CAFDAT        XXEFDT
     C*
     C     PRKY          SETGT     PPR01                                         GET PROC CODE
     C     NXTPR2        TAG
     C                   READP     PPR01                                  60     RECORD
     C*
     C*  A hard error will cause the program to terminate ASAP.
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '1'
     C     PRCPT4        ORNE      DHPRCD
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     CADSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      '98'          QQC(Q)
     C* Err Msg 98: "Invalid Procedure Code, See Programmer"
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C                   END
     C     PRSTAT        CABEQ     'I'           NXTPR2
     C*
     C*== FS Reimbursement = "N" ======================================
     C*
     C*  If fee schedule reimbursement equals 'N', but the MRA is equal
     C*     to zero, take the information as is.
     C     PRFSR         IFEQ      'N'
     C*
     C*  Flag to display Fee Schedule non-reimburseable Error Message
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XX25EM
     C*
     C     PRMRA         IFEQ      *ZEROS
     C                   Z-ADD     CACHRG        XPTOTA
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTD
     C                   Z-ADD     CACHRG        XPTOTP
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C                   GOTO      NXTRCD                                       GET NEXT RECORD
     C*
     C                   ELSE
     C*
     C*  If fee schedule reimbursement equals 'N' But the MRA
     C*    is greater than zero, this CPT4 Code has been assigned a
     C*    specific MRA by the insurance company.
     C     CACHRG        COMP      PRMRA                              60
     C   60              MOVE      '202'         XPEOMB
     C* EOMB Code 202: "Charges exceed maximum allowance found in
     c*                 reimbursement manual."
     C   60              Z-ADD     PRMRA         XPTOTA
     C  N60              Z-ADD     CACHRG        XPTOTA
     C     CACHRG        SUB       XPTOTA        XPTOTD
     C                   Z-ADD     XPTOTA        XPTOTP
     C*
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C                   GOTO      NXTRCD                                       GET NEXT RECORD
     C                   END
     C                   END
     C*
     C*====================================================================
     C*== FS Reimbursement = "Y" ==========================================
     C*
     C*  If Fee Schedule Reimbursement equals 'Y', use MRA
     C*
     C*  Save the procedure code file values.
     C     PRFSR         IFEQ      'Y'
     C                   Z-ADD     PRANAM        SXANAM
     C                   MOVE      PRRPT         SXRPT
     C                   MOVE      PRSUPP        SXSUPP
     C                   MOVE      PRSURG        SXSURG
     C                   MOVE      PR1A1         SX1A1
     C                   MOVE      PR1A2         SX1A2
     C                   MOVE      PR1A3         SX1A3
     C                   MOVE      PR1A4         SX1A4
     C                   MOVE      PR1A5         SX1A5
     C     SVRGN#        IFEQ      1
     C                   Z-ADD     PRMRA         SXMRA
     C                   Z-ADD     PRPROF        SXPROF
     C                   MOVE      PR92N1        SX92N1
     C                   MOVE      PR92NF        SX92N2                         ADD 01/03/95
     C                   ELSE
     C     SVRGN#        IFEQ      2
     C                   Z-ADD     PR92N3        SXMRA
     C                   Z-ADD     PR92N4        SXPROF
     C                   MOVE      PR92N5        SX92N1
     C                   MOVE      PR92NG        SX92N2                         ADD 01/03/95
     C                   ELSE
     C     SVRGN#        IFEQ      3
     C                   Z-ADD     PR92N7        SXMRA
     C                   Z-ADD     PR92N8        SXPROF
     C                   MOVE      PR92N9        SX92N1
     C                   MOVE      PR92NH        SX92N2                         ADD 01/03/95
     C                   ELSE
     C     SVRGN#        IFEQ      4
     C                   Z-ADD     PR92NB        SXMRA
     C                   Z-ADD     PR92NC        SXPROF
     C                   MOVE      PR92ND        SX92N1
     C                   MOVE      PR92NI        SX92N2                         ADD 01/03/95
     C                   END                                                    END EQ 4
     C                   END                                                    END EQ 3
     C                   END                                                    END EQ 2
     C                   END                                                    END EQ 1
     C*
     C*--------------------------------------------------------------------
     C*-- By Report -------------------------------------------------------
     C     PRRPT         IFEQ      'Y'
     C*
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     CADSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      '91'          QQC(Q)
     C* Err Msg 91: "Carrier to set payment on individual case basis
     C*             based on documentation"
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     CACHRG        XPTOTD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTA
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTP
     C*
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C                   GOTO      NXTRCD                                       GET NEXT RECORD
     C*
     C                   END                                                    END PRRPT EQ 'Y'
     C*
     C*--------------------------------------------------------------------
     C*-- INDIVIDUAL CONSIDERATION ----------------------------------------
     C     PRRPT         IFEQ      'I'
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     CADSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      'AO'          QQC(Q)
     C* Err Msg AO: "This service is to be reimbursed per individual
     C*             considerastion"
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     CACHRG        XPTOTD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTA
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTP
     C*
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C                   GOTO      NXTRCD                                       GET NEXT RECORD
     C*
     C                   END                                                    END PRRPT EQ 'I'
     C*
     C*--------------------------------------------------------------------
     C*-- ANE/Amount Not Established --------------------------------------
     C     PRRPT         IFEQ      'A'
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     CADSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      '24'          QQC(Q)                         ANE MESSAGE
     C* Err Msg 24: "The item is ANE - requires further inspection
     C*             by an adjuster"
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     CACHRG        XPTOTD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTA
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTP
     C*
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C                   GOTO      NXTRCD                                       GET NEXT RECORD
     C*
     C                   END                                                    END PRRPT EQ 'A'
     C*
     C*================================================================
     C*== Normal Processing of Procedure Code =========================
     C*
     C*-----------------------------------------------------------------
     C*-- Execute all Subroutines here ---------------------------------
     C*
     C     DHPRCD        IFGE      '00100'                                      ANESTHESIA
     C     DHPRCD        ANDLE     '01999'
     C                   EXSR      ANES
     C                   ELSE                                                      ELSE ANES
     C                   EXSR      OTHE                                         OTHER CODES
     C*
     C                   END                                                    END ANES     'Y'
     C                   END                                                    END PRFSR EQ 'Y'
     C                   END                                                    END EQ 'S/N'
     C*
     C*** ELSE IS OVERRIDE ********************************************
     C                   ELSE                                                   OVERRIDE TYPE
     C*
     C*  Test for a possible duplicate claim.
     C*
     C                   MOVE      DHPRCD        XXCPT4
     C*
     C     DHKY2         CHAIN     PDH03                              54
     C*
     C     *IN54         DOWEQ     *OFF
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     DHDSEQ        KKDSEQ
     C*
     C     CAKYP2        CHAIN     PCA0P                              61
     C*
     C     *IN61         IFEQ      *OFF
     C*
     C     PXFDAT        ANDEQ     CAFDAT
     C     PXFEIN        ANDEQ     CAFEIN
     C     PXDSEQ        ANDNE     CADSEQ
     C     PXFLAG        ANDNE     'P'
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     SVDSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      '03'          QQC(Q)
     C* Err Msg 03: Possible Duplicate claim exists for this item.
     C*
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C     DHKY2         READE     PDH03                                  54
     C*
     C                   ENDDO
     C*
     C     CAKY1A        CHAIN     PCA01                              60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C*   If override type, we must still output the allowed/disallowed
     C     CAMRA         IFEQ      0
     C     CAOTHR        ANDEQ     0
     C     CAOTH2        ANDEQ     0
     C     CANDIS        ANDEQ     0
     C     CAPAID        ANDEQ     0
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTA
     C*
     C*   If there is an override percentage, calculate
     C     CSOVRP        IFGT      *ZERO
     C     CSOVRP        DIV       100           XXOVRP
     C     CACHRG        MULT      XXOVRP        XPTOTA
     C                   END
     C*
     C     CACHRG        SUB       XPTOTA        CAMRA
     C                   Z-ADD     XPTOTA        CAPAID
     C                   END
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     SXMRA         CAMRAA
     C                   UPDATE    PCA01
     C*
     C                   END
     C                   END                                                    END EQ OVRRD
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  CAFDAT IFGE
     C*
     C*** Process next record *****************************************
     C     NXTRCD        TAG
     C*
     C     CAKYH1        READE     PCA01                                  54      GET NEXT RCD
     C*                                                      TO PROCESS
     C                   ENDDO
     C*
     C* ---------------------------------------------------------------
     C* --- Get and save the Provider's Zip Code/Region ---------------
     C* --- this will be used in each subroutine to determine conversion factor
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        SVZIP
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        SVRGN#
     C                   MOVE      ' '           ZIPERR
     C                   MOVEL     EOFLIC        SVZIP
     C     ZRKY          SETGT     PZR01
     C                   READP     PZR01                                  60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C     SVZIP         ANDGE     ZRFZCD
     C     SVZIP         ANDLE     ZRTZCD
     C                   MOVE      ZRRGN#        SVRGN#
     C                   ELSE                                                   ELSE 0 *IN60
     C* If no hit on Zip/Region file, then use lowest region
     C                   Z-ADD     4             SVRGN#
     C                   MOVE      '1'           ZIPERR
     C                   END                                                    END 0 *IN60
     C* ---------------------------------------------------------------
     C*
     C*  End the program
     C     TERM          TAG
     C*
     C*  Release all the formats for a save return.
     C*
     C     DUMMY         CHAIN     PCA01                              54
     C  N54              EXCEPT    ECA01
     C     DUMMY         CHAIN     PCA08                              54
     C  N54              EXCEPT    ECA08
     C*
     C* Write adjudication messages to FDMGP
     C                   EXSR      MSG
     C*
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SXMRA
     C                   RETURN
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *INLR
     *********************************************************************
     C     ANES          BEGSR
     C*
     C*=== Calculating Time Units =====================================
     C* The Time Units for all procedures is computed by allowing 1 unit
     C* for each 15 minutes of anesthesia time.  In addition each fraction
     C* of a quarter hour will be reimbursed at 1 unit.
     C*
     C*  1.0 Unit for each 15 minutes or any fraction thereof greater than 5 min
     C     DHUNTS        DIV       15            HLANMN
     C** Round up all fractions of 15 minutes to an additional Time Unit
     C                   MVR                     HLADDT
     C                   ADD       HLANMN        HLADDT
     C                   Z-ADD     HLANMN        HLANTV
     C     HLADDT        IFGT      *ZEROS
     C                   ADD       1             HLANTV
     C                   END
     C*
     C** Total Anesthesia Value * Conversion Factor = Fee
     C     HLANTV        ADD       SXANAM        HLANTV
     C     HLANTV        MULT(H)   SXMRA         SXMRA
     C*
     C** Modifier calculations
     C* ===============================================================
     C* PAGE 4, #4
     C* Effective for anesthesia services rendered on or after january
     C* 1, 1998, the medical direction allowance and the medically
     C* directed Certified Registered Nurse Anesthetist and Anesthesiol
     C* Anesthsiologist Assistant allowance are 52.5% of the allowance
     C* that would be paid if the service had been performed by the
     C* physician alone.
     C*
     C     SVSPCD        IFEQ      'RNA'
     C*
     C     SXMRA         MULT      52.5          SXMRA
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* PAY NOTHING
     C* ===============================================================
     C* Calculate Payment
     C     CACHRG        COMP      SXMRA                              60
     C   60              Z-ADD     SXMRA         XPTOTA
     C  N60              Z-ADD     CACHRG        XPTOTA
     C     CACHRG        SUB       XPTOTA        XPTOTD
     C                   Z-ADD     XPTOTA        XPTOTP
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C* Update charge with payment
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C* ===============================================================
     C*
     C     ANESE         ENDSR
     *********************************************************************
     *********************************************************************
     *** UPDATE FADEP WITH EOMB                                E O M B   *
     *********************************************************************
     C     EOMB          BEGSR
     C*
     C* Find the EOMB description
     C                   MOVEL(P)  XPEOMB        EBKEY
     C*
     C     EBKY          CHAIN     PEB01                              60
     C*
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      *OFF
     C*
     C                   MOVEL     EBDESC        XXNOT1
     C*
     C                   ELSE
     C*
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       XXNOT1
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN60=ON
     C*
     C                   MOVE      'A'           KKESRC
     C*
     C* Determine if an EOMB already exists for this DSEQ number
     C     DEKY          CHAIN     PDE01                              60
     C*
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      *OFF
     C*
     C                   MOVE      XPEOMB        DEEOB
     C                   MOVEL(P)  XXNOT1        DENOT1
     C*
     C* Update file maintenance fields
     C                   MOVE      Q1USER        DEUSER
     C                   MOVE      Q1PGM         DEPGM
     C*
     C                   TIME                    DSDTTM
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     DSDATE        SRDTI
     C*
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C*
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         DEDT
     C                   Z-ADD     DSTIME        DETIME
     C*
     C                   UPDATE    PDE01
     C*
     C                   ELSE
     C*
     C* No EOMB exists so find the next sequence number and add to file
     C     DEKY1         SETGT     PDE02
     C     DEKY1         READPE    PDE02                                  60
     C*
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      *OFF
     C                   ADD       1             DESEQ#
     C*
     C                   ELSE
     C                   Z-ADD     1             DESEQ#
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN60=OFF
     C*
     C                   MOVE      QQCO#         DECO#
     C                   MOVE      QQSUB#        DESUB#
     C                   MOVE      QQFND         DEFND
     C                   MOVE      QQFYR         DEFYR
     C                   MOVE      QQCASE        DECASE
     C                   MOVE      QQSS#         DESS#
     C                   MOVE      XXACDT        DEACDT
     C                   MOVE      QQEOB#        DEEOB#
     C                   MOVE      KKDSEQ        DEDSEQ
     C                   MOVE      XPEOMB        DEEOB
     C                   MOVE      XXNOT1        DENOT1
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       DENOT2
     C                   MOVE      'A'           DESTAT
     C                   MOVE      'A'           DEESRC
     C                   Z-ADD     XXRCN         DERCN
     C*
     C* Update file maintenance fields
     C                   MOVE      Q1USER        DEUSER
     C                   MOVE      Q1PGM         DEPGM
     C                   MOVE      Q1USER        DEIUSR
     C                   MOVE      Q1PGM         DEIPGM
     C*
     C                   TIME                    DSDTTM
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     DSDATE        SRDTI
     C*
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C*
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         DEDT
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         DEIDT
     C                   Z-ADD     DSTIME        DETIME
     C                   Z-ADD     DSTIME        DEITIM
     C*
     C                   WRITE     PDE01
     C* Restore the sequence number key field to the current record
     C                   Z-ADD     SVDSEQ        KKDSEQ
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN60=OFF
     C*
     C     EOMBE         ENDSR
     *********************************************************************
     *** ADJUDICATION MESSAGES SUBROUTINE                    M S G       *
     *********************************************************************
     C     MSG           BEGSR
      *
      * Load the template
      *
     C                   MOVEL     'XX00000'     XXMSG#
      *
      * Is this message already in the file for this line item
      *
     C                   Z-ADD     1             N                 5 0
      *
     C     N             DOWLE     9999
      *
     C     QQC(N)        IFEQ      '00'
      *
     C                   LEAVE
      *
     C                   ENDIF
      *
     C                   MOVE(P)   QQS(N)        KKDSEQ
     C                   MOVE      QQC(N)        XXMSG#
      *
     C     MGKY2         CHAIN     PMG02                              60
      *
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      *ON
      *
      * Find the next available message sequence number
      *
     C     MGKY1         SETGT     PMG01
     C     MGKY1         READPE(N) PMG01                                  60
      *
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      *OFF
      *
     C     MGMSEQ        ADD       1             XXMSEQ
      *
     C                   ELSE
      *
     C                   Z-ADD     1             XXMSEQ
      *
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN60 = OFF
      *
      * Write the new adjudication message to FDMGP
      *
     C                   Z-ADD     QQCO#         MGCO#
     C                   Z-ADD     QQSUB#        MGSUB#
     C                   MOVE      QQFND         MGFND
     C                   MOVE      QQFYR         MGFYR
     C                   MOVE      QQCASE        MGCASE
     C                   MOVE      *ZEROS        MGDCS#
     C                   Z-ADD     QQEOB#        MGEOB#
     C                   Z-ADD     KKDSEQ        MGDSEQ
     C                   Z-ADD     XXMSEQ        MGMSEQ
     C                   MOVE      'S'           MGSRC
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       MGCSI
     C                   MOVE      XXMSG#        MGMSG#
     C                   MOVE      'A'           MGSTAT
     C                   Z-ADD     XXRCN         MGRCN
      *
     C                   MOVE      Q1USER        MGUSER
     C                   MOVE      Q1PGM         MGPGM
     C                   MOVE      Q1PGM         MGIPGM
     C                   MOVE      Q1USER        MGIUSR
      *
     C                   TIME                    DSDTTM
      *
     C                   Z-ADD     DSTIME        MGTIME
     C                   Z-ADD     MGTIME        MGITIM
      *
     C                   Z-ADD     DSDATE        SRDTI
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         MGDT
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         MGIDT
      *
     C                   WRITE     PMG01
      *
     C                   ENDIF                                                  *IN60 = OFF
      *
     C                   ADD       1             N
      *
     C                   ENDDO                                                  N LE 999
      *
     C     MSGE          ENDSR
     C*
     *********************************************************************
     *** NEW PROVIDER SUBROUTINE (LEVEL BREAK)               N E W P R O *
     *********************************************************************
     C     NEWPRO        BEGSR
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     CADSEQ        HLDSEQ                         SAVE FIELD VALS
     C                   MOVE      CAFEIN        HLFEIN                         FOR RECORD WE
     C                   MOVE      CAMOD         HLMOD                          ARE PROCESSING
     C                   MOVE      CAPRTY        HLPRTY
     C                   Z-ADD     CAEOB#        HLEOB#
     C                   Z-ADD     CACHK#        HLCHK#
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     HLDSEQ        CADSEQ                         SAVE FIELD VALS
     C                   MOVE      HLFEIN        CAFEIN                         FOR RECORD WE
     C                   MOVE      HLMOD         CAMOD                          ARE PROCESSING
     C                   MOVE      HLPRTY        CAPRTY
     C                   Z-ADD     HLEOB#        CAEOB#
     C                   Z-ADD     HLCHK#        CACHK#
     C*   Reget record.
     C     CAKYZ         CHAIN     PCA01                              54
     C*
     C  N54              EXCEPT    ECA01
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     CADSEQ        SVDSEQ
     C                   MOVE      CAFEIN        SVFEIN                            CURR REC.
     C                   MOVE      CAMOD         SVMOD
     C                   MOVE      CAPRTY        SVPRTY
     C                   Z-ADD     CAEOB#        SVEOB#
     C                   Z-ADD     CACHK#        SVCHK#
     C*
     C*----------------------------------------------------------------
     C* Get and save the Provider's Specialty Code
     C     PDKY          CHAIN     PPD01                              60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C                   MOVE      QQSPCD        SVSPCD                         CHG 12/28/92
     C                   END
     C*
     C* ---------------------------------------------------------------
     C* --- Get and save the Provider's Zip Code/Region ---------------
     C* --- this will be used in each subroutine to determine conversion factor
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        SVZIP
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        SVRGN#
     C                   MOVE      ' '           ZIPERR
     C                   MOVEL     EOFLIC        SVZIP
     C     ZRKY          SETGT     PZR01
     C                   READP     PZR01                                  60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C     SVZIP         ANDGE     ZRFZCD
     C     SVZIP         ANDLE     ZRTZCD
     C                   MOVE      ZRRGN#        SVRGN#
     C                   ELSE                                                   ELSE 0 *IN60
     C* If no hit on Zip/Region file, then use lowest region
     C                   Z-ADD     4             SVRGN#
     C                   MOVE      '1'           ZIPERR
     C                   END                                                    END 0 *IN60
     C* ---------------------------------------------------------------
     C*
     C                   MOVE      CAFEIN        SXFEIN
     C                   MOVE      CAMOD         SXMOD
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C*
     C     NEWPRE        ENDSR
     *********************************************************************
     *** HANDLE ALL OTHER CODES   XXXXX-XXXXX                    O T H E *
     *********************************************************************
     C     OTHE          BEGSR
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C* Use other fee if Place of Service is an Hospital Outpatient
     C* (referenced in manuals for all items marked with '*')
     C     DHPOS         IFEQ      '2'
     C     SX92N2        ANDGT     *ZERO
     C                   MOVE      SX92N2        SXMRA
     C                   END
     C* ===============================================================
     C*
     C* The only two modifiers that were indicated for a specific payment
     C* were modifier -26 and the Technical Component.  No modifier was
     C* given for the Technical Component so we will use modifier -27.
     C* All other modifiers will pay the "whole amount", but with the
     C* modifier "error message".
     C*
     C     XPPMOD        IFNE      *BLANKS
     C*
     C     XPPMOD        IFEQ      '26'
     C                   MOVE      SXPROF        SXMRA
     C*
     C                   ELSE
     C*
     C     XPPMOD        IFEQ      '27'
     C                   MOVE      SX92N1        SXMRA
     C*
     C                   ELSE
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     CADSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      '76'          QQC(Q)
     C*** Err Msg 76: "CPT modifier used with this charge.  Verify use
     C***              and payment."
     C*
     C                   END                                                    END EQ '27'
     C                   END                                                    END EQ '26'
     C                   END                                                    END EQ *BLANKS
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C* Page 3, #2
     C* Effective January 1, 1998 Medicare Policy "bundles" payment for
     C* hot and cold packs into payment for other services provided
     C* during the same office visit.
     C*
     C     DHPRCD        IFEQ      '97010'
     C*
     C                   MOVE      '97012'       XXCPT4
     C*
     C     CAKY6         SETLL     PCA06
     C     CAKY6A        READE     PCA06                                  60
     C*
     C     *IN60         DOWEQ     '0'
     C     X6CPT4        IFGE      '97012'
     C     X6CPT4        ANDLE     '97265'
     C     X6CPT4        ORGE      '99201'
     C     X6CPT4        ANDLE     '99499'
     C     X6FDAT        IFEQ      CAFDAT
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTA
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTP
     C     CACHRG        SUB       XPTOTA        XPTOTD
     C                   MOVE      '201'         XPEOMB
     C* EOMB Code 201: "This procedure is included in the basic allowan
     C*                "of another procedure."                         owed"
     C*
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C                   GOTO      OTHEE
     C                   ENDIF                                                  END X6TOTP   10
     C                   ENDIF                                                  END X6CPT4   10
     C*
     C     CAKY6A        READE     PCA06                                  60
     C                   ENDDO                                                  END *IN60
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  END DHPRCD
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C* Page 3, #1
     C* Code ranges 98940 - 98943 will pay the highest mra
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        X                 1 0
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        X1                1 0
     C     DHPRCD        IFGT      '98940'
     C     DHPRCD        ANDLT     '98943'
     C*
     C*  THIS WILL GIVE A VALUE TO EACH CODE
     C*  IT ONLY ALLOWS THE HIGHEST VALUED CODE TO BE PAID
     C*  THIS PROGRAM DOES NOT HAVE TO PASSES, SO I SETUP A VALUE
     C*  SYSTEM
     C*
     C                   SELECT
     C     DHPRCD        WHENEQ    '98940'
     C                   MOVE      1             X
     C     DHPRCD        WHENEQ    '98941'
     C                   MOVE      2             X
     C     DHPRCD        WHENEQ    '98942'
     C                   MOVE      3             X
     C     DHPRCD        WHENEQ    '98943'
     C                   MOVE      4             X
     C                   ENDSL
     C                   MOVE      '98940'       XXCPT4
     C*
     C     CAKY6         SETLL     PCA06
     C     CAKY6A        READE     PCA06                                  60
     C*
     C     *IN60         DOWEQ     '0'
     C     X6CPT4        IFGT      '98940'
     C     X6CPT4        ANDLT     '98943'
     C*
     C                   SELECT
     C     X6CPT4        WHENEQ    '98940'
     C                   MOVE      1             X1
     C     X6CPT4        WHENEQ    '98941'
     C                   MOVE      2             X1
     C     X6CPT4        WHENEQ    '98942'
     C                   MOVE      3             X1
     C     X6CPT4        WHENEQ    '98943'
     C                   MOVE      4             X1
     C                   ENDSL
     C*
     C     X             IFLT      X1
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTA
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTP
     C     CACHRG        SUB       XPTOTA        XPTOTD
     C                   MOVE      '201'         XPEOMB
     C* EOMB Code 201: "This procedure is included in the basic allowan
     C*                "of another procedure."                         owed"
     C*
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C                   GOTO      OTHEE
     C                   ENDIF                                                  END X/X1     10
     C                   ENDIF                                                  END X6CPT4   10
     C*
     C     CAKY6A        READE     PCA06                                  60
     C                   ENDDO                                                  END *IN60
     C*
     C                   ENDIF                                                  END DHPRCD
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C* Calculate Payment
     C     CACHRG        COMP      SXMRA                              60
     C   60              Z-ADD     SXMRA         XPTOTA
     C  N60              Z-ADD     CACHRG        XPTOTA
     C     CACHRG        SUB       XPTOTA        XPTOTD
     C                   Z-ADD     XPTOTA        XPTOTP
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZEROS        XPDIFF
     C                   Z-ADD     SXMRA         XPBRTC
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C* Update charge with payment
     C                   EXSR      UPDAT
     C* ===============================================================
     C*
     C     OTHEE         ENDSR
     *********************************************************************
     *** Update                                                U P D A T *
     *********************************************************************
     C     UPDAT         BEGSR
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C* If no other EOMB code was applied, and there was no match of the
     C*   Provider's Zip Code with the Zip/Region file, then give EOMB
     C*   indicating that the lowest region (base) was used to calculate payment
     C     ZIPERR        IFEQ      '1'
     C     XPEOMB        ANDEQ     *BLANK
     C                   MOVE      '205'         XPEOMB
     C* EOMB Code 205: "Improper PA Zip Code submitted: Payment calculated
     C*                 on lowest region"
     C                   END
     C*
     C     ZIPERR        IFEQ      '1'
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     CADSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      'BK'          QQC(Q)
     C* Err Msg BK: "Improper PA Zip Code submitted: Payment calculated on
     C*             base region"
     C                   END
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C* Establish default EOMB code, if necessary
     C     XPTOTD        IFGT      *ZERO
     C     XPEOMB        ANDEQ     *BLANK
     C     XPTOTP        ANDGT     *ZEROS
     C                   MOVE      '202'         XPEOMB
     C*** EOMB 202: "Charges exceed Maximum Allowance found in reimburse manual"
     C                   END
      *
     C     XPEOMB        IFNE      *BLANKS
      *
     C                   Z-ADD     SVDSEQ        KKDSEQ
     C                   EXSR      EOMB
      *
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C** TEST FOR A POSSIBLE DUPLICATE CLAIM.
     C*
     C                   MOVE      DHPRCD        XXCPT4
     C*
     C     DHKY2         CHAIN     PDH03                              54
     C*
     C     *IN54         DOWEQ     *OFF
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     DHDSEQ        KKDSEQ
     C*
     C     CAKYP2        CHAIN     PCA0P                              61
     C*
     C     *IN61         IFEQ      *OFF
     C*
     C     PXFDAT        ANDEQ     CAFDAT
     C     PXFEIN        ANDEQ     CAFEIN
     C     PXDSEQ        ANDNE     CADSEQ
     C     PXFLAG        ANDNE     'P'
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 60
     C  N60              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     SVDSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      '03'          QQC(Q)
     C* Err Msg 03: Possible Duplicate claim exists for this item.
     C*
     C                   ENDIF
     C*
     C     DHKY2         READE     PDH03                                  54
     C*
     C                   ENDDO
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C** Only process the record if not an override type
     C*
     C     CAKY1A        CHAIN     PCA01                              54
     C     CSOVRD        IFNE      'Y'
     C                   Z-ADD     XPTOTA        CATOTA
     C                   Z-ADD     XPTOTD        CAMRA
     C                   Z-ADD     XPTOTP        CAPAID
     C                   MOVE      XPPMOD        XPPMOD
     C                   MOVE      XPEOMB        CAEOMB
     C*
     C                   MOVE      Q1USER        CAUSER
     C                   MOVE      Q1PGM         CAPGM
     C                   TIME                    DSDTTM
     C                   Z-ADD     DSDATE        SRDTI
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         CADT
     C                   Z-ADD     DSTIME        CATIME
     C*
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     SXMRA         CAMRAA
     C  N54              UPDATE    PCA01
     C* If Fee Schedule non-reimburseable ... display error message
     C* XX25EM Flag is set at beginning of program where PRFSR eq 'N'
     C     XX25EM        IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      DHPRCD        XXCPT4
     C     CAKY6         CHAIN     PCA06                              60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '0'
     C                   Z-ADD     1             Q
     C     '00000'       LOOKUP    QQS(Q)                                 61
     C  N61              Z-ADD     9999          Q
     C                   MOVEL     CADSEQ        QQS(Q)
     C                   MOVE      '19'          QQC(Q)
     C* Err Msg 19: *WARNING* Need Letter of Medical Necessity to pay this item
     C                   MOVE      '0'           XX25EM
     C                   END                                                    ENDIF *IN60
     C                   END                                                    ENDEQ '1'
     C                   END
     C*
     C* ===============================================================
     C*
     C** Clear the work fields
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTA
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XPTOTP
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       XPPMOD
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        XPEOMB
     C* ===============================================================
     C*
     C     UPDAE         ENDSR
     *********************************************************************
     OPCA01     E            ECA01
     OPCA08     E            ECA08
     *********************************************************************
